    },
    {
      "id": "claim_fb9e4a1c9422456499e81ea92676cbfd",
      "statement": "Despite the README and main.py's --date help text describing the default (no --date) window as 'the latest 24 hours', gdelt.py actually fetches 6 hours of data: UPDATES=24 refers to 24 GDELT GKG files published every 15 minutes (24 * 15min = 6 hours), not 24 hours. This is a known doc/code mismatch between the CLI help/README prose and the actual gdelt.py behavior.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L26-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:11205dac9304f70412cf782f31d65f09d21c146735e30c6cc4eef692177b0a85:"
