      "id": "claim_c2503ce1f56e42219b6d6c40d4e91910",
      "statement": "Because graph.py's module-level graph object is compiled without a checkpointer or store, LangGraph Studio threads created via `uv run langgraph dev` are persisted by Studio's own dev-server storage and are entirely separate from data/threads.db, which only holds state for threads run via the main.py CLI.",
